Asteroid Miner

## Repository
https://github.com/MalachiBunck/Programming-for-Digital-Arts-Final.git

## Description
I will be making a clicker game about mining asteroids as a fun way to fill time. This project will be creating a playable desktop game that will be in a small window off to the side so when you get bored you can mine the asteroid.

## Features
- Feature 1
	- A large asteroid you can click to increase a point value.
- Feature 2
	- Upgrades that you spend points on to help you mine the asteroid.
- Feature N 
	- An auto clicker that idlely increases the point value without interaction.

## Challenges
- I will need to learn how to make a background that is bigger than the display window to allow for scrolling.
- I will need to learn how to make interactable buttons so the player can choose upgrades.
- I may want a save system to the players score isn't deleted.

## Outcomes
Ideal Outcome:
- The ideal outcome is a small clicker game with upgrades the player can click on to use points to help with score increase and a score save feature to allow the tab to be closed

Minimal Viable Outcome:
- The bare minimum is a clicker game with an upgrade that gives you auto clickers for auto score increase

## Milestones

- Week 1
  1. Create the window with clickable asteroid
  2. Have point display with increase on click of asteroid

- Week 2
  1. Make the background bigger with scrollable window
  2. Add a clickable button that removes points

- Week N (Final)
  1. Add a score increase over time if upgrade clicked
  2. Make the auto clicker stackable and add indicator under it to show hom many they have